<title>UK: Chesterfield in 19 mln stg sites disposal.</title>
<headline>Chesterfield in 19 mln stg sites disposal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British real estate group Chesterfield Properties Plc said on Wednesday it had sold a portfolio of five industrial estates for 19 million stg.</p>
<p>Chesterfield said the sale price reflected an initial net yield of 11.6 percent. The portfolio produced annual rental income of 2.264 million stg.</p>
<p>Chesterfield said the Mars Pension Trustees Ltd bought most of the portfolio.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
